{
 "duration": 383.85775,
 "units": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "beat": 0,
   "chapter": "Intro",
   "text": "It is five thirty in the morning and I have not moved for three hours.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 4.177
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "beat": 0,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Not my legs.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 4.477,
   "end": 5.59
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "beat": 0,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Not my hands.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 5.89,
   "end": 6.973
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "beat": 1,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "My mother is in the chair by my window.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 7.423,
   "end": 9.617
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "beat": 1,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "My father is propped against the foot of my bed.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 9.917,
   "end": 12.533
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "beat": 1,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Both of them are turned to face me, and both of their mouths are open.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 12.833,
   "end": 16.944
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "beat": 2,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "The smell of blood in here is so strong I can taste it.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 17.394,
   "end": 20.663
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "beat": 2,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Neither of them has blinked since I woke up.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 20.963,
   "end": 23.512
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "beat": 3,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "The thing that put them there has not left this room.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 23.962,
   "end": 26.894
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "beat": 3,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "If it finds out I am awake, I die in this bed, and there is nobody left in this house to stop it.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 27.194,
   "end": 33.215
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "beat": 4,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Let us go back to the beginning.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 33.665,
   "end": 35.28
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "beat": 5,
   "chapter": "The scream",
   "text": "Three hours ago I was asleep, like any other night.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 35.88,
   "end": 39.073
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "beat": 6,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "The last thing I remember before all of it is my mother at my door with the landing light behind her.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 39.523,
   "end": 45.567
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "beat": 7,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "\"Lights out, love. I do not want to hear that tablet at midnight.\"",
   "who": "family",
   "start": 46.017,
   "end": 49.42
  },
  {
   "i": 14,
   "beat": 8,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "And my father, further down the hall, not even coming in.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 49.87,
   "end": 53.046
  },
  {
   "i": 15,
   "beat": 9,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "\"Door is locked, mate. Go to sleep.\"",
   "who": "stranger",
   "start": 53.496,
   "end": 55.868
  },
  {
   "i": 16,
   "beat": 10,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "He checked the locks every night of my life.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 56.318,
   "end": 58.684
  },
  {
   "i": 17,
   "beat": 10,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "I need you to know that he checked them that night too.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 58.984,
   "end": 61.688
  },
  {
   "i": 18,
   "beat": 11,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "At 2:20 I woke up because somebody was screaming on the other side of the house.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 62.138,
   "end": 67.43
  },
  {
   "i": 19,
   "beat": 12,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Not a shout.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 67.88,
   "end": 68.793
  },
  {
   "i": 20,
   "beat": 12,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Not a word.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 69.093,
   "end": 70.002
  },
  {
   "i": 21,
   "beat": 12,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "A long high scream that stopped in the middle, like a door had been closed on it.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 70.302,
   "end": 74.825
  },
  {
   "i": 22,
   "beat": 13,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "This is a retelling, inspired by a story told online.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 75.275,
   "end": 78.89
  },
  {
   "i": 23,
   "beat": 14,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "I sat up.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 79.34,
   "end": 80.129
  },
  {
   "i": 24,
   "beat": 14,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "I got to my door.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 80.429,
   "end": 81.69
  },
  {
   "i": 25,
   "beat": 14,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "I want that on the record, because of what I did next.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 81.99,
   "end": 85.109
  },
  {
   "i": 26,
   "beat": 15,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "You are twelve years old and somebody just screamed.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 85.559,
   "end": 88.308
  },
  {
   "i": 27,
   "beat": 15,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Do you go and look, or do you use the bathroom first?",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 88.608,
   "end": 91.719
  },
  {
   "i": 28,
   "beat": 16,
   "chapter": "The wrong three minutes",
   "text": "My body told me something very stupid.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 92.319,
   "end": 94.629
  },
  {
   "i": 29,
   "beat": 16,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "I needed the toilet.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 94.929,
   "end": 96.191
  },
  {
   "i": 30,
   "beat": 17,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Somebody had screamed in my house, and I turned left into the bathroom first.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 96.641,
   "end": 101.331
  },
  {
   "i": 31,
   "beat": 18,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "I have had three hours to think about those three minutes.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 101.781,
   "end": 104.768
  },
  {
   "i": 32,
   "beat": 19,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "I put the light on.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 105.218,
   "end": 106.456
  },
  {
   "i": 33,
   "beat": 19,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "I remember the light.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 106.756,
   "end": 107.999
  },
  {
   "i": 34,
   "beat": 19,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "It was the last normal thing that ever happened to me.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 108.299,
   "end": 111.275
  },
  {
   "i": 35,
   "beat": 20,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "I washed my hands, because that is what you do, even at half past two, even after that.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 111.725,
   "end": 117.052
  },
  {
   "i": 36,
   "beat": 21,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Then I turned the light off, opened the door a crack, and looked out at the hall.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 117.502,
   "end": 121.726
  },
  {
   "i": 37,
   "beat": 22,
   "chapter": "Blood on the carpet",
   "text": "There was blood on the carpet.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 122.326,
   "end": 123.816
  },
  {
   "i": 38,
   "beat": 23,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Not a drop.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 124.266,
   "end": 125.171
  },
  {
   "i": 39,
   "beat": 23,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "A smear.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 125.471,
   "end": 126.178
  },
  {
   "i": 40,
   "beat": 23,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "A wide dark one that started at the far end by my parents' room and went all the way to the top of the stairs.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 126.478,
   "end": 133.157
  },
  {
   "i": 41,
   "beat": 24,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Something heavy had been pulled along that carpet.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 133.607,
   "end": 136.065
  },
  {
   "i": 42,
   "beat": 25,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "The front door was down those stairs.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 136.515,
   "end": 138.49
  },
  {
   "i": 43,
   "beat": 25,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Twelve steps, the hall, one latch, and then the street, and the Kellys across the road with their bedroom light still on.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 138.79,
   "end": 145.878
  },
  {
   "i": 44,
   "beat": 26,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "I did not go down the stairs.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 146.328,
   "end": 148.062
  },
  {
   "i": 45,
   "beat": 27,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Blood on the carpet.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 148.512,
   "end": 149.723
  },
  {
   "i": 46,
   "beat": 27,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "The front door is twelve steps away.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 150.023,
   "end": 152.065
  },
  {
   "i": 47,
   "beat": 27,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Do you run for it, or hide in your bed?",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 152.365,
   "end": 154.522
  },
  {
   "i": 48,
   "beat": 28,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "I went back into my room, got into my bed, and pulled the sheets over my head like a seven-year-old, as if that does anything to anything.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 154.972,
   "end": 163.471
  },
  {
   "i": 49,
   "beat": 29,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "I lay under there and told myself I was dreaming.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 163.921,
   "end": 166.926
  },
  {
   "i": 50,
   "beat": 29,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "I kept that up for about eight minutes.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 167.226,
   "end": 169.316
  },
  {
   "i": 51,
   "beat": 30,
   "chapter": "The door",
   "text": "Then my bedroom door creaked open.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 169.916,
   "end": 172.008
  },
  {
   "i": 52,
   "beat": 31,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "And because something in me needed to know, I pulled the blanket down off one eye and looked.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 172.458,
   "end": 177.522
  },
  {
   "i": 53,
   "beat": 32,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "It was bent over in my doorway, and it was far too tall for my room.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 177.972,
   "end": 182.121
  },
  {
   "i": 54,
   "beat": 33,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "It was hairless.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 182.571,
   "end": 183.571
  },
  {
   "i": 55,
   "beat": 33,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "All of it.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 183.871,
   "end": 184.608
  },
  {
   "i": 56,
   "beat": 33,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Nothing on its head, no eyebrows, nothing anywhere.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 184.909,
   "end": 187.882
  },
  {
   "i": 57,
   "beat": 34,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "It had no eyes.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 188.332,
   "end": 189.478
  },
  {
   "i": 58,
   "beat": 34,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "I do not mean shut, or white, or hidden.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 189.779,
   "end": 192.108
  },
  {
   "i": 59,
   "beat": 34,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "There was nothing on its face where eyes go, and nothing where a mouth goes either.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 192.408,
   "end": 197.019
  },
  {
   "i": 60,
   "beat": 34,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "A smooth pale plate, hanging lower than its own shoulders.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 197.319,
   "end": 200.837
  },
  {
   "i": 61,
   "beat": 35,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "It wore nothing at all.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 201.287,
   "end": 202.807
  },
  {
   "i": 62,
   "beat": 36,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "It moved like something that was never taught to stand up, back slouched right over, arms hanging past its knees.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 203.257,
   "end": 210.191
  },
  {
   "i": 63,
   "beat": 37,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "And it was dragging my mother and my father into my bedroom by the arms, one in each hand.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 210.641,
   "end": 216.174
  },
  {
   "i": 64,
   "beat": 38,
   "chapter": "The masterpiece",
   "text": "It was not stupid.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 216.774,
   "end": 218.006
  },
  {
   "i": 65,
   "beat": 38,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "That is the part I need you to understand.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 218.306,
   "end": 220.861
  },
  {
   "i": 66,
   "beat": 39,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "A thing that walks like that should not have been able to do what it did next.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 221.311,
   "end": 225.3
  },
  {
   "i": 67,
   "beat": 40,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "It propped my father against the foot of my bed, sitting up, and turned his face until he was looking at my pillow.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 225.75,
   "end": 232.236
  },
  {
   "i": 68,
   "beat": 41,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Then it lifted my mother into the chair by my window and turned her the same way.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 232.686,
   "end": 237.315
  },
  {
   "i": 69,
   "beat": 42,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "It arranged them.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 237.765,
   "end": 238.823
  },
  {
   "i": 70,
   "beat": 42,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Like a photograph.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 239.123,
   "end": 240.316
  },
  {
   "i": 71,
   "beat": 42,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Like something that wanted the picture to come out right.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 240.616,
   "end": 243.342
  },
  {
   "i": 72,
   "beat": 43,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Then it put both hands flat on my wall and started dragging them along it.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 243.792,
   "end": 247.875
  },
  {
   "i": 73,
   "beat": 44,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "It drew a circle.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 248.325,
   "end": 249.376
  },
  {
   "i": 74,
   "beat": 44,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Then a star inside the circle, upside down, five points, the kind of thing boys scratch on the back of their school books.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 249.676,
   "end": 257.192
  },
  {
   "i": 75,
   "beat": 45,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "It was painting with my parents.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 257.642,
   "end": 259.451
  },
  {
   "i": 76,
   "beat": 45,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "And then it stepped back from the wall, the way you step back from a drawing.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 259.751,
   "end": 263.635
  },
  {
   "i": 77,
   "beat": 46,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Then it wrote something under the circle.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 264.085,
   "end": 266.072
  },
  {
   "i": 78,
   "beat": 46,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "One line of letters, pulled across my wallpaper with one finger.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 266.372,
   "end": 270.23
  },
  {
   "i": 79,
   "beat": 47,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "It was too dark.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 270.68,
   "end": 271.762
  },
  {
   "i": 80,
   "beat": 47,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "I could not read it.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 272.062,
   "end": 273.262
  },
  {
   "i": 81,
   "beat": 48,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "And then it got down on my floor, folded itself up, and went under my bed.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 273.712,
   "end": 278.243
  },
  {
   "i": 82,
   "beat": 49,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Under my bed.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 278.693,
   "end": 279.704
  },
  {
   "i": 83,
   "beat": 49,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "With me on top of it.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 280.004,
   "end": 281.319
  },
  {
   "i": 84,
   "beat": 50,
   "chapter": "Five thirty",
   "text": "That was three hours ago.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 281.919,
   "end": 283.397
  },
  {
   "i": 85,
   "beat": 51,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Here is the thing about lying still for three hours.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 283.847,
   "end": 286.725
  },
  {
   "i": 86,
   "beat": 51,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Your eyes get better at the dark.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 287.025,
   "end": 288.919
  },
  {
   "i": 87,
   "beat": 52,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "The clock on my table says 5:30.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 289.369,
   "end": 291.643
  },
  {
   "i": 88,
   "beat": 52,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "My window has gone from black to grey.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 291.943,
   "end": 294.136
  },
  {
   "i": 89,
   "beat": 52,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "And the writing on my wall has been getting clearer for about twenty minutes.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 294.436,
   "end": 298.516
  },
  {
   "i": 90,
   "beat": 53,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "I have not looked at it.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 298.966,
   "end": 300.437
  },
  {
   "i": 91,
   "beat": 53,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "I have been looking at my father instead, because he is the only thing in this room that cannot hurt me.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 300.737,
   "end": 306.474
  },
  {
   "i": 92,
   "beat": 54,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "I have one plan and it is a bad one.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 306.924,
   "end": 309.262
  },
  {
   "i": 93,
   "beat": 54,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "The door is nine feet away.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 309.562,
   "end": 311.226
  },
  {
   "i": 94,
   "beat": 54,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "I run, I take the stairs, I get the latch, and I scream until the Kellys put their light on.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 311.526,
   "end": 317.194
  },
  {
   "i": 95,
   "beat": 55,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Nine feet.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 317.644,
   "end": 318.531
  },
  {
   "i": 96,
   "beat": 55,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "And it is under the bed.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 318.831,
   "end": 320.305
  },
  {
   "i": 97,
   "beat": 55,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "I would have to put my feet on the floor.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 320.605,
   "end": 322.598
  },
  {
   "i": 98,
   "beat": 56,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Nine feet to the door.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 323.048,
   "end": 324.336
  },
  {
   "i": 99,
   "beat": 56,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "It is under the bed.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 324.636,
   "end": 325.965
  },
  {
   "i": 100,
   "beat": 56,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Do you stay still, or run?",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 326.265,
   "end": 327.851
  },
  {
   "i": 101,
   "beat": 57,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "So I have been doing the only thing I can do, which is nothing at all.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 328.301,
   "end": 332.322
  },
  {
   "i": 102,
   "beat": 57,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Breathing slow.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 332.622,
   "end": 333.599
  },
  {
   "i": 103,
   "beat": 57,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Keeping my face soft.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 333.899,
   "end": 335.342
  },
  {
   "i": 104,
   "beat": 57,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Not blinking too much, because I read once that they can tell.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 335.642,
   "end": 339.383
  },
  {
   "i": 105,
   "beat": 58,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "\"It does not know I am awake.\"",
   "who": "you",
   "start": 339.833,
   "end": 341.525
  },
  {
   "i": 106,
   "beat": 59,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "I have been saying that to myself for three hours.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 341.975,
   "end": 344.64
  },
  {
   "i": 107,
   "beat": 60,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "I am going to read the wall now.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 345.09,
   "end": 346.989
  },
  {
   "i": 108,
   "beat": 60,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "I do not want to.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 347.289,
   "end": 348.471
  },
  {
   "i": 109,
   "beat": 60,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "But I would rather know what it says than die next to it not knowing.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 348.771,
   "end": 352.61
  },
  {
   "i": 110,
   "beat": 61,
   "chapter": "The message",
   "text": "So I move my eyes.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 353.21,
   "end": 354.605
  },
  {
   "i": 111,
   "beat": 61,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Not my head.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 354.905,
   "end": 355.896
  },
  {
   "i": 112,
   "beat": 61,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Just my eyes, right, to the circle and the star and the line underneath it.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 356.196,
   "end": 360.524
  },
  {
   "i": 113,
   "beat": 62,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "And my eyes have adjusted.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 360.974,
   "end": 362.493
  },
  {
   "i": 114,
   "beat": 62,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "And I can read it.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 362.793,
   "end": 363.902
  },
  {
   "i": 115,
   "beat": 63,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "It says: I know you're awake.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 364.352,
   "end": 366.006
  },
  {
   "i": 116,
   "beat": 64,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Under the bed, something shifts its weight.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 366.456,
   "end": 368.548
  },
  {
   "i": 117,
   "beat": 65,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "It was never waiting to find out if I woke up.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 368.998,
   "end": 371.677
  },
  {
   "i": 118,
   "beat": 65,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "It wrote that before I opened my eyes, because it already knew.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 371.977,
   "end": 375.661
  },
  {
   "i": 119,
   "beat": 66,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "It has been waiting three hours for me to read it.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 376.111,
   "end": 378.702
  },
  {
   "i": 120,
   "beat": 67,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "If you were in that bed, would you have stayed still, or run for the door?",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 379.152,
   "end": 382.658
  }
 ]
}